    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d666-a4">

                <pb facs="0994" n="866" xml:id="pg866"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 4 in No. 22.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Robeson to Mr.
                            Heap</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Beirut</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1885-08-07"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 7,
                        1885</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your telegram, received several days ago, was lodged by me with Vali, and by
                    Schumacher with Mutassarif of Acca, against the expulsion of or illegal
                    interference with American citizens at Safed, or elsewhere in Syria, by Turkish
                    authorities. Particulars by mail.</p>
                <closer><signed>ROBESON.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
